00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:26.590
*swipes floor*
Now here are my criteria for my bounties.

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:30.020
Obviously when making predictions like these
you need to make some assumptions.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:35.449
I'm personally guessing that there will only
be one last big bounty update in the story

00:08:35.449 --> 00:08:39.149
overall after Wano.

00:08:39.149 --> 00:08:44.159
The straw hats are about to free the land
of the samurai, standing against two Yonko

00:08:44.159 --> 00:08:48.670
and they will come out of it as a Yonko crew
themselves.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:54.370
Everything past the time-skip has lead to
this moment, so of course we need new bounties,

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:55.370
right?

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:59.209
However, other than Roger, who jumped to the
top by finding the one piece and learning

00:08:59.209 --> 00:09:04.080
the true history, I don't think Luffy and
co will get another increase after reaching

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.120
Laugh tale.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:17.480
After all, Roger was too early and had to
prepare the next generation.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:22.300
Luffy meanwhile is the one who will actually
topple the current system and make a world

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:24.379
that is better for everyone to live in.

00:09:24.379 --> 00:09:28.940
With the big war at the end of the story,
I don't think there will be time for the government

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:34.730
to make new bounty posters and after that
government won't be there anymore.

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:38.210
The other thing, we will look at are patterns
in the bounties.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:42.420
And for Luffy his bounties actually are part
of Oda's storytelling.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:49.810
And part of it will obviously me being bias
and just going the way I feel would make sense.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:51.720
So first: Chopper.

00:09:51.720 --> 00:10:00.480
I think the joke with choppers bounty being
ridiculously low is pretty funny and I want

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.920
to see it until the end.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:05.410
However at the same time he deserves some
recognition.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:11.500
One way around that would be if chopper got
2 bounties instead of one.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:17.360
One normal one, super low, and one for his
monster point form, which we could put somewhere

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:19.490
around the 300M mark.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:23.589
A bounty Luffy once had, but still the lowest
in the crew.

00:10:23.589 --> 00:10:28.329
I think all the straw hats will crack the
300M.

00:10:28.329 --> 00:10:30.709
Next we have Nami.

00:10:30.709 --> 00:10:39.110
As the navigator of the pirate king and increasing
power, Nami will get a solid boost for her

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.110
final bounty.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:44.180
I think putting it up to 400M would be reasonable.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:52.930
The next spots are a bit trickier, because
everyone gets very powerful from here.

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:57.880
Brook is one of my favorite characters and
I believe he is heavily underestimated in

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:04.269
how dangerous he can be, but I don't see him
going far beyond Nami in terms of bounty.

00:11:04.269 --> 00:11:07.480
420 seems a reasonable number.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:08.959
Hehe.

00:11:08.959 --> 00:11:17.420
Now, even though Franky proves to us over
and over again how strong he is, and possibly

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:22.170
still having the plans of the pluton, he is
one of the straw hats who gets very little

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.889
recognition from the government.

00:11:23.889 --> 00:11:30.709
I'll put him here with around 490M Berry,
more than Sasaki's 472M, but less than our

00:11:30.709 --> 00:11:34.769
next candidate: Usopp.

00:11:34.769 --> 00:11:42.839
Usopp has gotten a ridiculous 200M berry bounty
after Dressrosa, but as we all know he is

00:11:42.839 --> 00:11:48.279
living up to his ideal of becoming a brave
warrior of the sea more and more.

00:11:48.279 --> 00:11:56.189
And since he seems to follow round numbers,
similar to luffy, going from 30 to 200, 500M

00:11:56.189 --> 00:12:03.209
would be the perfect spot for him after Wano,
more than doubling his current one.

00:12:03.209 --> 00:12:07.170
Now we're getting into interesting territory.

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:13.300
I am actually going to put Jinbei in 5th place
here.

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:19.209
He's a former warlord and incredibly strong,
but not quite Zoro, Sanji Luffy material.

00:12:19.209 --> 00:12:23.290
However, Jinbe might be very close to the
1B mark.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:37.100
He went from 76 to 250 to 438, which includes
all numbers, except 1 and 9, so why not 910M

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:41.089
berries.

00:12:41.089 --> 00:12:49.069
Ah yes.

00:12:49.069 --> 00:12:51.069
Zoro and Sanji.

00:12:51.069 --> 00:12:54.399
Even Oda has made fun with the bounties between
the two.

00:12:54.399 --> 00:13:00.730
Nonetheless, Zoro's role in the crew is a
bit more centred around combat, while Sanji

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:06.290
is also the cook and in general a much more
personality-based character, I actually made

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:09.580
videos about both recently as well.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:14.800
I think both will overcome king and queen
and get bounties higher than them.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:20.690
Being commanders on a new emperor's ship,
both will pass 1B berries, just a little bit

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:21.690
apart.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:29.279
I'd like Zoro to surpass Luffy's current bounty,
so 1.5B plus 90M for assura's 9 sword style.

00:13:29.279 --> 00:13:37.149
Sanji meanwhile I could see somewhere around
the 1.3B mark, plus maybe some 66M for accepting

00:13:37.149 --> 00:13:38.250
his germa heritage.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:46.759
Now, if you've paid attention, you will have
realized that before Luffy, there is still

00:13:46.759 --> 00:13:52.410
one straw hat unaccounted for.

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:59.869
I have no idea whether Oda looks at this the
same way as I do, but I personally would love

00:13:59.869 --> 00:14:07.029
to see Robin's bounty surpass Zoro and Sanji,
not because of her power, but because of who

00:14:07.029 --> 00:14:08.160
she is.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:13.869
We already know that other Yonko are trying
to steal her for her knowledge, and so is

00:14:13.869 --> 00:14:14.869
CP0.

00:14:14.869 --> 00:14:24.339
After Wano, once Luffy will shift his eyes
towards Laugh Tale, Robin will be the key

00:14:24.339 --> 00:14:28.079
to everything.

00:14:28.079 --> 00:14:32.100
The government knows this and will try to
stop it at any cost.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:37.430
So I would Robin not only to be chased, but
to get the respect for that as well, with

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:48.459
a 2B berry bounty, making her the most wanted
woman in the world after Big Mom's defeat.

00:14:48.459 --> 00:14:51.470
Now finally we have Luffy.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:55.760
And admittedly until now there was not too
much to go off of with the other straw hats.

00:14:55.760 --> 00:15:01.029
For Luffy however, bounties have always played
an important role, which makes it easier for

00:15:01.029 --> 00:15:04.180
me to predict his final bounty.

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:08.249
For that we have to look at the numbers of
luffs bounty compared to the enemies he has

00:15:08.249 --> 00:15:15.670
defeated and how the bounty system keeps pushing
Luffy's unique rise to power into our faces.

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:18.310
Let's start in the east blue.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:30.170
Luffy's first bounty are 30M Berries after
defeating Buggy (15), Kuro (16), Don Krieg

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:33.500
(17) and Arlong (20).

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.730
That's 150% of Arlongs bounty.

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:42.680
And Luffy's bounties will keep outgrowing
his enemies' at this rough rate.

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:46.190
Luffy is presented as the strongest man in
the east blue.

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:50.449
What better way to set him up as the protagonist
and a real threat to the government.

00:15:50.449 --> 00:15:54.889
The next increase is in Albasta, that is actually
quite similar to wano.

00:15:54.889 --> 00:15:59.319
Both are big Saga's, leading up to a showdown
with one of the most powerful people in this

00:15:59.319 --> 00:16:04.870
part of the grand line, crocodile the warlord
and Kaido the yonko, both of whom have bounties

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:10.879
far exceeding Luffy's and seem to be unbeatable
for him at first, Crocodile's logia versus

00:16:10.879 --> 00:16:13.380
Kaido's conqueror's Haki.

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:19.350
Before that Luffy faces Mihawk and big mom,
but it's never really about fighting on that

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:30.190
level yet.

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:36.990
After defeating Crocodile, who was frozen
at 81M, luffy triples his bounty to 100M,

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:42.889
over 120% that of his opponent, establishing
himself as someone who can play on the warlord

00:16:42.889 --> 00:16:52.540
level, just as he will be able to compete
on the yonko level after wano.

00:16:52.540 --> 00:17:00.029
Ennies lobby is a bit different.

00:17:00.029 --> 00:17:04.830
Here the bounties are all about the perceived
threat to the world government and not power

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:05.830
in itself.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:12.800
That's why luffy's enemy has no bounty, while
his own triples to 300M after declaring war

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.280
on the government itself.

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:18.320
The next one if maybe the most curious one
though.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:24.530
After defeating Moria, breaking into and out
of impel down and participating at Marineford,

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:36.180
after all that stuff, Luffy's bounty only
increases to 400M.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:41.930
You might also have felt like that was too
low, however it wonderfully shows us how Oda

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:46.240
uses bounties to illustrate Luffy's development.

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:51.670
This is Luffy's biggest defeat in the story
so far, not being able to save his crew or

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.750
his brother.

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:57.860
It's utter defeat that would have felt weird
to us, the audience, with a ridiculously high

00:17:57.860 --> 00:17:58.860
bounty.

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:13.170
Plus, once again it's 125% of Moria's bounty,
who was at 320M.

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:21.980
Dressroas gave Luffy another 100M, bringing
him to 500, 166% that of Caesar's and 150%

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:22.980
of Dofis.

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:29.290
It was a hard fight, but both arcs were only
setup for wano and taking down a yonko.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:35.010
So taking down another warlord was not as
significant as it was before the timeskip,

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.210
even if it was Dofi.

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:42.900
A real curveball in this was then Whole Cake
Island, the last increase so far.

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:53.370
Now, playing on Commander level, luffy surpasses
both cracker and Katakuri, tripling his Bounty

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:58.590
to 150% of Katakuri's 1B.

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:03.860
This ridiculously high new bounty might have
made less sense from the perspective of the

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:09.050
world government, but again as a storytelling
device it does.

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:15.360
Luffy had to surpass himself, facing off against
a version of himself that was better than

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:17.260
him at everything.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:24.220
It feels deserved to us and to me really hammered
home luffy's achievement on Whole Cake island.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:28.780
So after all this, the strongest creature
in the world is now standing in front of Luffy

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:37.340
with a bounty fo 4.6B berries, 3 times that
of Luffy just like crocodile.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:40.340
After defeating an enemy, Luffy has always
surpassed them.

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:46.480
So if we assume that luffy's bounty increases
by 333% like in alabasta, that would round

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:49.270
up very nicely to 5B berries.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:55.510
However, since we are talking about Luffy's
final bounty in the story, I think he surely

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.530
has to surpass Roger.

00:19:57.530 --> 00:20:04.300
And Oda loves his wordplays, especially with
the Yonko bounties.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.370
Shanks' bounty has Shanks in it.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:07.370
Shi-ya-ku.

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:09.680
Kaido has the 100beasts in his.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:10.680
Hyaku-juu.

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:16.500
Big mom has mom in hers, ha-ha, whitebeard
has Shiro in it, as in white, Shiro hige.

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:19.840
And roger's simply speels ro-ji-ya.

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:24.940
Going with this pattern and the pattern of
Luffy's bounty so far, I'm gonna predict that

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:36.530
Luffy's final bounty will be 5,656,000,000,
go mu go mu, barely surpassing Roger himself.

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:40.480
And speaking of the gomu gomu no mi, if you
want to know what LUffy's awakening might

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:52.030
be and why it is already here, go watch that
video right here.

